  "summary": "Palomar Trolley Center is a 183,000 square foot community shopping center in Chula Vista anchored by Food 4 Less, Ross, and DD's Discounts, featuring over 30 national and regional retailers, restaurants, and service providers. Strategically located at a high-traffic intersection near I-5 and adjacent to the Palomar Street Trolley & Transit Center, the center serves both local residents and cross-border shoppers from nearby Mexico.",
